  m_Name: Tycoon Blackwood
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Tycoon Blackwood
  offerText: My tailored suits are taking up your entire closet. I will pay you a
    modest fee right now to let them hang there for the hour.
  acceptResultText: The suits cramp your room completely. But while brushing past
    them, a thick wad of bills falls out of a silk pocket. Blackwood won't even miss
    it!
  rejectResultText: You tell him your closet is not a hotel. You enjoy your empty
    space, but miss out on his fee.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: You remember the fee you missed and feel like a dummy.
